  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> A blast of shrapnel removes chunks from one side of your face, including one ear and quite a bit of cheek, leaving white jawbone visible through the rents.</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (3). Lose one ear – Amputation (Average). Also, the extensive scarring gains you a penalty of -5 to your Fellowship in any situation where a handsome exterior is imperative.</p>"
